lumo-theme (1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * PNG image-missing fallback (SVG-only unthemed icons are discarded when
    the gdk-pixbuf SVG loader is absent -> infinite recursion); install
    librsvg2-common so Papirus SVG icons actually load.

  * Ship guaranteed image-missing fallback icons (hicolor + pixmaps):
    GTK 4.18 real_choose_icon() infinite-recurses (stack overflow) when
    any icon lookup misses everywhere - the image-missing fallback must
    always resolve.

  * Initial Lumo OS 1.0 "Aurora" release.

